{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-length-of-agreement.md","title":"阶段一致长度与 use restraint","display":"df-length-of-agreement — 阶段一致长度与 use restraint","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-length-of-agreement","aliases":["20-df-length-of-agreement"],"display":"df-length-of-agreement — 阶段一致长度与 use restraint","chapter":"7","section":"7.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§7.4.1 的 length of agreement 与 restraint；阶段签名展开","source_pdf_pages":[190,191],"source_printed_pages":[156,157],"depends_on":["[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-length-of-agreement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-length-of-agreement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-length-of-agreement — 阶段一致长度与 use restraint"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§7.4.1 的 length of agreement 与 restraint；阶段签名展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>190</span><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span><span>157</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s,C_s\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A_s,C_s\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 为可计算阶段有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}\\)</span> 表示 s 步有界 oracle 模拟。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}length\\text{-}of\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell(e,s):=\\max\\{n\\le s:\\forall x&lt;n\\\n[\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_{C_s}(x)]\\},\\\\\nr(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le\\ell(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}length\\text{-}of\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell(e,s):=\\max\\{n\\le s:\\forall x&lt;n\\\n[\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_{C_s}(x)]\\},\\\\\nr(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le\\ell(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空初段 0 总满足一致条件，因此最大值存在。已收敛计算的 use 才参与 restraint；还须包含首个不一致位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\ell(e,s)\">\\(x=\\ell(e,s)\\)</span> 上可能已有的停止计算。原书 Lemma 7.4.2 明确指出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le\\ell\">\\(x\\le\\ell\\)</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;\\ell\">\\(x&lt;\\ell\\)</span> 的必要性：c.e. 目标位从 0 变为 1 后，即使一致长度下降，该位置的分歧计算仍受到保护。只保留严格初段会遗漏这一步。采用本目录半开 use，保护条件为未来新增元素均不小于 r。若目标允许双向变化，需进一步使用历史最大一致长度，见第 7.6 节的独立模块。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.4.1 的 length of agreement 与 restraint；阶段签名展开；印刷页 156, 157；PDF 第 190, 191 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：有界 oracle 模拟现在直接采用 oracle-stage-evaluation 的有限停止历史定义，避免用非相对阶段模拟符号充当未声明 oracle 原语。空集合参与最大值的 0 约定保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s,C_s\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}length\\text{-}of\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell(e,s):=\\max\\{n\\le s:\\forall x<n\\\n[\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_{C_s}(x)]\\},\\\\\nr(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le\\ell(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"x=\\ell(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"x<\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":2159,"backlinks":[{"id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。"},{"id":"daa141317125dee0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"617ac90f851b7f95","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-ce-preservation]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]。"}],"outgoing":["4ef1aee16db6b308","4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","01d522a0b0df3738"]}